From: Eduard Ryzhov <1711255+ryzed@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gcc-msm8976: keep the Venus TBU clock on

Keep the Venus TBU clocks always on (CLK_IS_CRITICAL): nothing votes for them on this board.
One of the experiments around Venus.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-msm8976.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-msm8976.c
@@ -3692,6 +3692,8 @@
 		.enable_mask = BIT(20),
 		.hw.init = &(struct clk_init_data){
 			.name = "gcc_venus_1_tbu_clk",
+			/* kenzo: голос за TBU видеоблока никто не ставит — держим включённым */
+			.flags = CLK_IS_CRITICAL,
 			.ops = &clk_branch2_ops,
 		},
 	},
@@ -3705,6 +3707,8 @@
 		.enable_mask = BIT(5),
 		.hw.init = &(struct clk_init_data){
 			.name = "gcc_venus_tbu_clk",
+			/* kenzo: голос за TBU видеоблока никто не ставит — держим включённым */
+			.flags = CLK_IS_CRITICAL,
 			.ops = &clk_branch2_ops,
 		},
 	},
